---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section text="Get in Touch" href="contact">
  <h2 class="mb-5 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#F5F7FA] md:text-5xl">Have an Idea Worth Building?</h2>
  <p class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[#A3ACBA] md:text-lg">I'm always interested in technology, product development, innovative ideas, and opportunities to build something meaningful. If you'd like to discuss a project, explore a collaboration, or simply connect, feel free to reach out.</p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
    <a class="inline-block rounded-full bg-[#6C8CFF] px-8 py-5 text-sm font-medium text-[#0B0D12] transition-all hover:bg-[#86A0FF]" href="mailto:sekandar.dev@gmail.com?subject=Portfolio%20Inquiry">Contact Me</a>
    <a class="inline-block rounded-full border border-[#252B38] px-8 py-5 text-sm font-medium text-[#F5F7FA] transition-colors hover:border-[#6C8CFF] hover:text-[#6C8CFF]" href="#projects">Explore My Projects</a>
  </div>
</Section>
